 and experience digital objects alongside your surroundings in mixed reality.\n\nFor creators, Future Lens brings spatial editing into the headset. Use your existing Future Lens account to open your spaces, arrange 3D objects, and compose experiences with images, video, narration, and interactive story steps.\n\nExplore together in supported shared spaces, with optional voice chat and collaborative interactions. Switch between virtual and mixed reality as the experience allows.\n\nPublic spaces can be explored without signing in. Creating, saving, and accessing private spaces requires an existing Future Lens account and appropriate access. An internet connection is needed for cloud content and online features. Location-aligned mixed reality requires a supported mapped place and camera permission; availability varies by experience. Microphone permission is optional for voice features.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest 3 and Meta Quest 3S.", "short_description": "Explore immersive spaces and create interactive stories with 3D objects, panoramas, and mixed reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://futurelens.cloud/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Treasuremaps", "support_website_url": "https://futurelens.cloud/contact", "website_url": "https://futurelens.cloud/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "15895763395